Pure-red face tuning plus apply. Edit freely. Two-decimal order keeps the group contiguous; loads before setup.

** Faces — Banner & Title

#+begin_src emacs-lisp
(defun cyberdeck/pure-red--aiu-cyber-desk-banner ()
  (with-eval-after-load 'dashboard
    (dolist (face '(dashboard-banner-logo-title dashboard-text-banner))
      (when (facep face)
        (set-face-attribute face nil
                            :foreground "#FFFFFF" :background 'unspecified :weight 'bold :inherit nil)))))
#+end_src

